      "file": "T3/GroupTheory/Coproduct/Basic.lean",
      "assessment": "The generator identity for the same sumToCoproduct/coproductToSum inverse maps is discharged by definitional equality. Both maps and sumEquivCoproduct signature are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "file": "T3/GroupTheory/Coproduct/Presentation.lean",
      "assessment": "Explicit Free.lift_of on left/right sum generators proves the same factor restrictions. The projectionLeft calculation still applies identity on the left and the trivial homomorphism on the right; no relation subgroup, projection or filtration is changed."
    },
    {
      "file": "T3/GroupTheory/Free/Collection.lean",
      "assessment": "The explicit Pairwise Commute proof is derived from the existing IsMulCommutative G hypothesis. The map remains Subgroup.noncommPiCoprod on the same cyclic subgroups, with unchanged finite and 3^Nat.card J conclusions."
    },
    {
      "file": "T3/GroupTheory/Free/Graded.lean",
      "assessment": "The existing derived commutator is supplied explicitly to layerTwoEquiv_mk. Generator order, bracket convention and graded readout are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "file": "T3/LinearAlgebra/ExteriorTensor.lean",
      "assessment": "The private rfl lemma exposes the same Fin.append function of appendOrderEmbedding. Subsequent proofs use it instead of unfolding the OrderEmbedding constructor. Left-before-right ordering and exterior tensor construction are preserved."
